1. INITIALIZATION
=================================================================
Load the UILib from either local file or GitHub:

    local UILib
    -- Try local file first
    if isfile and isfile("UILIB.lua") then
        UILib = loadstring(readfile("UILIB.lua"))()
    else
        -- Fallback to GitHub
        UILib = loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ncmpuff/UILib/main/UILIB.lua"))()
    end

