14. PANEL NAVIGATION (ShowPanel, HidePanel)
=================================================================
Programmatically control panel visibility.

    Window:ShowPanel("Combat")         -- Show panel by name
    Window:HidePanel("Combat")         -- Hide panel (or click same panel again)

NOTES:
- ShowPanel automatically hides the previous panel
- Clicking the same panel button toggles its visibility

=================================================================
15. TOGGLE KEY (AddToggleKey)
=================================================================
Add a keybind to show/hide the entire GUI.

SYNTAX:
    Window:AddToggleKey(Enum.KeyCode.RightShift)

DEFAULT: Right Shift key

EXAMPLE:
    -- Toggle GUI with Right Shift
    Window:AddToggleKey(Enum.KeyCode.RightShift)
    
    -- Or use a different key
    Window:AddToggleKey(Enum.KeyCode.Insert)

